e-addons is the new must-have tool-set for web experts. Exploit the limitless potentials of Elementor, with powerful widgets & extensions, and boost your workflow.

== Description ==

**EXTEND YOUR ELEMENTOR SKILLS. RIGHT NOW.**

Whether you’re a designer or a developer E-ADDONS is the one-for-all Elementor plug-in. A lot of useful widgets ready to use. Easy to install, On-Off functionality to keep your website efficient and performant. A team of experts is working everyday to guarantee support and add constantly new brilliant features.

**GIVE YOUR ELEMENTOR WEBSITES SUPERPOWERS**

With E-ADDONS for Elementor you can offer your clients the most advanced features any website should have. Lots of new improved widgets from Pro-Forms new logics and controls, plenty of widgets to improve front-end overall like Parallax movements and smooth text animations to mention a few. If you’re a developer you’ll appreciate above all the dynamic tags and possibility to write php in the browser.

**HIGHLIGHTS**

* One framework to extend Elementor capabilities
* Intuitive dashboard easy to use
* On-off philosophy to optimize website performance
* Wide range of useful and ready to go widgets and extensions
* Made by a team of experts with 25yrs of experience 
* Daily support and Regular updates
* No stop developing New widgets and Extensions
* Hugely documented
* Open to new requests to implement

= FEATURES =

**E-ADDONS FOR ELEMENTOR**

**For Developers**

* [Screenshot.](https://e-addons.com/?p=621) Display image preview of any website always updated in real time.
* [iFrame.](https://e-addons.com/?p=617) Show external resource, by inserting the link code within your site.
* [Do_Shortcode.](https://e-addons.com/?p=220) Insert Wordpress shortcodes directly from Elementor panel.

**For Designers**

* [Extension Masking.](https://e-addons.com/?p=236) Apply a mask from .png or clip-path to the native widgets of Elementor video, image, or image-box.
* [Extension Masking for Heading Widget.](https://e-addons.com/?p=239) Fill the heading text with a gradient or a background image.
* [Extension Outline Stroke for Heading Widget.](https://e-addons.com/?p=240) Add border to your headlines. Pick width and stroke color.

**Elementor Utils**

* [Manager Settings.](https://e-addons.com/?p=3412) It removes all unneeded Elementor widgets. Great for your workflow and performance.
* [Col Alignment Fix.](https://e-addons.com/?p=3324) Fix column gap problem. Stretch, align to the main div, and let the space only between columns.
* [Wrapper Link.](https://e-addons.com/?p=1039) It allows to make the entire area of an element clickable.
* [Background Lazyload.](https://e-addons.com/?p=3328) The background of your sections will be loaded only on view, making your website faster.

*Many more features will be available soon.*

**MORE FREE E-ADDONS**

* [Extension Display.](https://e-addons.com/?p=210) Display conditions for every page Element.
* [Clipboard Cross-Domain Copy-Paste.](https://e-addons.com/?p=209) Copy the content from your site to another one straightaway. No more Export/Import.
* [Button Copy.](https://e-addons.com/?p=221) Add a simple Copy button to put content (form a Text, TextArea or Code) inside user Clipboard.
* [Frontend Inspector.](https://e-addons.com/?p=304) Analyze the page for a complete debug and increase its performance.
* [Posts Skin Template.](https://e-addons.com/?p=297) Custom Template for the Elementor-Pro Posts Widget.
* [Portfolio Skin template.](https://e-addons.com/?p=3468) Custom Template for the Elementor-Pro Portfolio Widget.
* [Widget Template.](https://e-addons.com/?p=212) Insert a Template wherever you want. Add more flexibility to your content.
* [Shortcode Template.](https://e-addons.com/?p=1437) It allows you to insert an Elementor Template wherever shortcodes are supported.
* [Dynamic Tag Template.](https://e-addons.com/?p=211) It lets you replace simple text Controls like Text, Textarea, and Wysiwyg with a custom Template.
* [Dynamic Tag Token.](https://e-addons.com/?p=208) It allows you to use the power of the Tokens to generate dynamic content in every control that supports dynamic tags.
* [Text Editor Token.](https://e-addons.com/?p=302) The Text Editor with now more dynamic features.
* [Editor Tweak.](https://e-addons.com/?p=403) Improvements to optimize the Elementor Editor.
* [Enhanced Dynamic Tags.](https://e-addons.com/?p=1302) It enables the Dynamic Tags on every supported control and forces the Dynamic Tags on all fields even on those where they’re not provided natively in Elementor, like Tabs.

